<Slide padding={60} style={{ background: '#FFFFFF', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 72, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', padding: 24, background: '#1E4FA8' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 34, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>成果亮点 · 三个可验证的技术点</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#CADCFC', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.2, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>03 · Achievements</Text></Box><Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 1, background: '#E5E7EB' }}></Box><Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 497, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 40, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.4, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>把前面四个界面与后面三个界面串起来的，是这三项可验证的实现要点。</Text></Box><Box style={{ width: 1160, marginTop: 12 }}><Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 328, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', gap: 12 }}><Box style={{ width: 372, height: 328, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 18, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ width: 30, height: 30, background: '#1E4FA8', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.0, margin: 0, marginTop: 0, textAlign: 'center' }}>01</Text></Box><Text style={{ fontSize: 23, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>课程记忆按课程隔离</Text><Box style={{ width: 200, height: 30, background: '#1E4FA8', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center', marginTop: 12 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>F06 / F33</Text></Box><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.55, margin: 0, marginTop: 14 }}>资料全文进入 prompt，切换课程即切换上下文；单份 4000 字、总量 12000 字预算，避免长资料挤占窗口。</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.4, margin: 0, marginTop: 12 }}>证据：study_check.py 本地 36/36</Text></Box><Box style={{ width: 372, height: 328, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 18, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ width: 30, height: 30, background: '#1E4FA8', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.0, margin: 0, marginTop: 0, textAlign: 'center' }}>02</Text></Box><Text style={{ fontSize: 23, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>安全 Markdown 渲染</Text><Box style={{ width: 200, height: 30, background: '#1E4FA8', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center', marginTop: 12 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>F27 / F31</Text></Box><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.55, margin: 0, marginTop: 14 }}>前端 escape-first 先转义再解析富文本，资料与回答中的标签不会被执行；三轮自查中完成 XSS 复测。</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.4, margin: 0, marginTop: 12 }}>证据：自我检查报告 12 节</Text></Box><Box style={{ width: 372, height: 328, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 18, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ width: 30, height: 30, background: '#1E4FA8', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.0, margin: 0, marginTop: 0, textAlign: 'center' }}>03</Text></Box><Text style={{ fontSize: 23, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>可插拔智能体与自动回退</Text><Box style={{ width: 200, height: 30, background: '#1E4FA8', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center', marginTop: 12 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>F20 – F23</Text></Box><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.55, margin: 0, marginTop: 14 }}>AgentProvider 抽象 + 工厂注册 6 个实现；未配置密钥或调用异常时降级演示模式，离线也能走通全流程。</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.4, margin: 0, marginTop: 12 }}>证据：demo_check.py 30/30</Text></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ width: 1160, marginTop: 12 }}><Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 46, background: '#E8EFF8', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: 16 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.4, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>亮点不写成口号：每一项都给出需求编号与可复核证据，答辩现场可现场验证。</Text></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 30, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>AI 校园学习陪伴助手  ·  课程作业答辩</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>17 / 28</Text></Box></Slide>